.* CMDSYSCTL: System Control Commands, a group of the major command menu.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 3'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='CMDSYSCTL'.
:IMPORT NAME=DSPLOG PNLGRP=QHMHCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=RCLSTG PNLGRP=QHLICMD.
:IMPORT NAME=RCLTMPSTG PNLGRP=QHLICMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKACTJOB PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS' NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAJOR'.F16=Major menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=CMDSYSCTL HELP=HLPCMDSYSCTL KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' PANELID=PANELID.System Control Commands
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUGRP.Commands
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD ?CHGRCYAP'.
:MENUI HELP=DSPLOG OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?DSPLOG'.Display Log  DSPLOG
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD ?DSPRCYAP'.
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD ?EDTRCYAP'.
:MENUI HELP=RCLSTG OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD ?RCLSTG'.Reclaim Storage  RCLSTG
:MENUI HELP=RCLTMPSTG OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD ?RCLTMPSTG'.Reclaim Temporary Storage  RCLTMPSTG
:MENUI OPTION=7 ACTION='CMD ?RGZDLO'.
:MENUI HELP=WRKACTJOB OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD ?WRKACTJOB'.Work with Active Jobs  WRKACTJOB
:EMENUGRP.
:MENUGRP.Related Command Menus
:MENUI HELP='CMDSYSCTL/OPT9' OPTION=9 ACTION='MENU CMDJOB'.Job Commands  CMDJOB
:MENUI HELP='CMDSYSCTL/OPT10' OPTION=10 ACTION='MENU CMDSTS'.Status Commands  CMDSTS
:MENUI HELP='CMDSYSCTL/OPT11' OPTION=11 ACTION='MENU CMDSYS'.System Commands  CMDSYS
:MENUI HELP='CMDSYSCTL/OPT12' OPTION=12 ACTION='MENU CMDSYSVAL'.System Value Commands  CMDSYSVAL
:EMENUGRP.
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPCMDSYSCTL.System Control Commands - Help
:P.System Control Commands: the commands and the command menus of this
group, as the major command menu arranges them, with each name at the
right of its row. A blank row is a command this release does not
provide.
:P.Type an option number and press Enter to prompt the command or show the
menu, or type a command on the command line. F12 returns to the previous
menu, F3 to the menu where you started and F16 to the major command
groups.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F16=Major menu
:PD.Shows menu MAJOR.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDSYSCTL/OPT9'.Job Commands  CMDJOB
:P.Option 9. Shows menu CMDJOB&colon. Job Commands CMDJOB.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDSYSCTL/OPT10'.Status Commands  CMDSTS
:P.Option 10. Shows menu CMDSTS&colon. Status Commands CMDSTS.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDSYSCTL/OPT11'.System Commands  CMDSYS
:P.Option 11. Shows menu CMDSYS&colon. System Commands CMDSYS.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDSYSCTL/OPT12'.System Value Commands  CMDSYSVAL
:P.Option 12. Shows menu CMDSYSVAL&colon. System Value Commands
CMDSYSVAL.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
